            "state": "ACTIVE",
            "content": "Initial FreetoShop architecture exploration for Clone Stamp implementation. Repository is a local-first browser-based image editor with TypeScript codebase in npm workspaces: apps/web (UI/app), packages/raster-engine, core-document, command-history, compositor, renderer, selection-engine, transform-engine, text-engine, file-codecs, persistence, filter-engine, pixel-storage. Current state: only toolRegistry.ts exists with placeholder entries; brush/eraser tools are listed in registry but not yet implemented as concrete classes. Key architectural principles from task: preserve tile-based storage, copy-on-write, command/history model; Clone Stamp must support aligned/unaligned modes, Alt/Option-click source setting, selection/mask respect, undoable transactions.",
